# The paths devbin's public snapshot carries, one git pathspec per line. The
# workroom scan (tests/unit/workroom.bats) and the snapshot builder both read
# this list, so what is scanned is what ships. A `:(exclude)` line leaves a path out:
# the fleet command is private to the development tree and does not ship.
bin/
lib/
tests/
docs/
packaging/
.github/
design/
README.md
LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md
RELEASES/
RELEASES.md
VERSION
.gitattributes
.gitignore
:(exclude)bin/.devbin/cmd/fleet
:(exclude)bin/.devbin/fleet.roots
:(exclude)bin/.devbin/help/fleet.md
:(exclude)tests/unit/fleet.bats
